            "review_title": "Review at An Duyen Vegan Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Alex C\nHilo, Hawaii13 contributions\n0\nBest Vegan Restaurant in Saigon!\nJun 2019 • Couples\nI don’t understand why this place has so few reviews, it’s a definite hidden gem. You won’t expect to find a restaurant like this in this part of town but it is worth seeking out if you are vegan/vegetarian, much better than some other vegan places we tried. Seemed popular with locals too, which is always a good sign.\nRestaurant was clean and the staff friendly.\nFood was prepared fresh, served hot and flavors were great. Good mix of Vietnamese dishes with a few thai and Chinese dishes as well.\nRead more\nWritten June 29, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
