            "review_title": "Review at An Duyen Vegan Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Linh Pham\n6 contributions\n1\nThe city hidden gem\nOct 2018 • Family\nIt is pretty hard to find vegan/vegetarian restaurant around district 5 (china town), and yet I think this is one of the best one in town. They have a wide variety of Asian cuisine which taste good, even for non-vegan/vegetarian people. The place is cozy and their staff is very friendly (but they don't speak much English, I rarely see any tourist here). They do have their menu in English.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten November 20, 2018",
