            "review_text": "Tran D\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam15 contributions\n1\nCozy place with tasty vegan food\nJun 2017 • Friends\nThis restaurant was a great discovery for us. We were wandering around the chinatown area and finally found out here! Recommended by my friend who is a vegetarian. \nFood was so good and tasty though its meatless. We ordered Crispy Rice Cake, Faux Roasted Pork with Vietnamese fish sauce with steamed rice and Crystal Salad those was plated very nice\nThere is such a cozy place by its \"zen\" ambience. An emphatic Asian decoration with the music make me feel so comfortable as well as chilling me from the heat of Saigon\nAs the service staff is also friendly and warm, I will come back here soon.\nRead more\nWritten June 7, 2017",
