            "review_text": "Trường Đ\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam135 contributions\n0\nOne of the best vegan restaurant in china town\nJun 2017 • Family\nI am so impressed by the restaurant decoration. Even my friend advice the light is bit dim, but combine with the decoration, music, concept, its creat the Asian ambiance!\nFood: vegan dishes but really tasty, more than what I expected. Other vegan restaurant always cook vegan with non-flavor. Besides, dishes plate so nice, good from eyes to tounge! \nPrice: In compare with other restaurant same class, this one is quite affordable (cheaper than what you get)\nService: Nice, well-trained and dedicated staffs\n\nOverall, If you are vegan lover, you must try!\nRead more\nWritten June 7, 2017",
